<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Helicopter 6-mth net up.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Helicopter 6-mth net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  10.87	 vs		5.23</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  1.57	 vs		1.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		  148.56	 vs	     82.05</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   16.69	 vs	     10.75</p>
<p>    Minorities  less	  0.23	 vs   less     0.21</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   9.45	 vs		0.70</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Malaysian Helicopter Services Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
